      {
        "id": 17841,
        "title": "Understanding Query Parameters",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Customize a collection",
            "id": 152139,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Public APIs often return large collections, whereas an app may need only items that match a single choice.</p><p>Query parameters let a request describe that choice. You'll learn to add them to URLs and Python requests.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  {&quot;id&quot;: 1, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;},\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  {&quot;id&quot;: 2, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;JavaScript&quot;},\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  {&quot;id&quot;: 3, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;HTML&quot;},\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  ...\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Start a query string",
            "id": 152140,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A question mark starts a query string after the endpoint. The parameter name comes next.</p><p>This API uses <code>id</code> to identify courses. Add the question mark and parameter name.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"post_url.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"34\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>?</code>, followed by <code>id</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add a parameter value",
            "id": 152141,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>An equals sign connects the parameter name to its value.</p><p>Add the value <code>1</code> to request the course with the id <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"post_url.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 1, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>, followed by <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>An equals sign connects the parameter name to its value.</p><p>Build the query string to request the course with <code>id</code> equal to <code>1</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"post_url.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 1, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>?</code>, followed by <code>id</code>, <code>=</code>, and finally <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Use different value types",
            "id": 152142,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parameter values can identify items with numbers, such as <code>1</code>, or match text, such as a course name.</p><p>Complete the string value that requests the course <code>Python</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"parameter_values.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"string_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?name=Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>Python</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parameter values can identify items with numbers, such as <code>1</code>, or match text, such as a course name.</p><p>This API uses <code>id</code> for numeric IDs and <code>name</code> for course names.</p><p>Request ID <code>1</code> in <code>number_url</code> and course <code>Python</code> in <code>string_url</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"parameter_values.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"number_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"string_url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?name=Python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"course\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>id</code>, followed by <code>name</code>, and finally <code>Python</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Choose another post",
            "id": 152143,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ask the API for the course with ID <code>3</code> by typing the query parameter name <code>id</code>, then an equals sign <code>=</code>, and finally the number <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"comment_feed.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?id=3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 3, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;HTML&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>id=3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Read a customized URL",
            "id": 152144,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which URL requests data from the API for a user with ID <code>4</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org/courses?userId=4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>This API filters users with the <code>userId</code> parameter.</p><p>Which URL requests data from the API for a user with ID <code>4</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org/courses?userId=4</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?id=4</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>https://mimo.org/users?userId=4</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Filter another resource",
            "id": 152145,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the code to ask for data from the user with the ID <code>3</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"todo_request.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/users?userId=3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?postId=3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>?userId=3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Fetch the user with ID <code>3</code> using the API's <code>userId</code> query parameter.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"todo_request.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/users?userId=3&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"postId\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>?</code>, followed by <code>userId</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>3</code>, and finally <code>get</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17858,
        "title": "Multiple Query Parameters",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "A More Focused Request",
            "id": 152218,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We already know we can use a query parameter as a filter. Let's look at how we can combine multiple filters to get an even better result.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 71, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Intro to Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the First Parameter",
            "id": 152219,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Before we get into combining multiple query strings, let's build a URL with one first.</p><p>Build a query string to filter courses by language.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>?</code> followed by <code>language</code> and then <code>=</code>, <code>python</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Make Room for Another",
            "id": 152220,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>An ampersand <code>&amp;</code> separates one query parameter from the next.</p><p>Add <code>&amp;</code> after the language parameter to make room for another one.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Second Parameter",
            "id": 152221,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The second parameter follows the ampersand without another question mark.</p><p>Add <code>level=beginner</code> to request beginner courses.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>level</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, and finally <code>beginner</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The second parameter follows the ampersand without another question mark.</p><p>Keep the language filter and add the <code>level</code> filter with value <code>beginner</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"language\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"python\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&amp;</code>, followed by <code>level</code>, <code>=</code>, and finally <code>beginner</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Add the Second Parameter - Copy",
            "id": 152240,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If we use <code>&amp;</code> to combine multiple query parameters, they will all be used in the query, as long as the API supports them.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If we use <code>&amp;</code> to combine multiple query parameters, they will all be used in the query, as long as the API supports them.</p><p>Request Python courses for beginners, keeping <code>language</code> first and <code>level</code> second.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"advanced\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"javascript\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>?</code>, followed by <code>python</code>, <code>&amp;</code>, and finally <code>beginner</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Send the Combined Request",
            "id": 152222,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The completed URL now contains both course filters.</p><p>Pass <code>url</code> to <code>requests.get()</code> to send the combined request.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 71, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Intro to Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>requests</code> followed by <code>.</code> and then <code>get</code>, <code>url</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The completed URL now contains both course filters.</p><p>Fetch courses matching both filters, then parse the response as JSON.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/courses?language=python&amp;level=beginner&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"data = response.json()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(data)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"101\" endIndex=\"104\" /><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"131\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status_code\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{&quot;id&quot;: 71, &quot;course&quot;: &quot;Intro to Python&quot;}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>requests</code>, followed by <code>get</code>, <code>url</code>, <code>response</code>, and finally <code>json</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Recall the Separator",
            "id": 152224,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which sign separates query parameters after the first one?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&amp;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>?</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which sign separates query parameters after the first one?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&amp;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>?</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>,</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&amp;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Filter Learner Profiles",
            "id": 152225,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A profile lookup already filters for <code>role=learner</code>.</p><p>Add <code>&amp;active=true</code> to return only active learners.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/users?role=learner&amp;active=true&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&amp;</code> followed by <code>active</code> and then <code>=</code>, <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A profile lookup already filters for <code>role=learner</code>.</p><p>The <code>active</code> filter uses <code>true</code> for active profiles. Keep the learner role and add that filter.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://mimo.org/users?role=learner&amp;active=true&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"teacher\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"role\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>learner</code>, followed by <code>&amp;</code>, <code>active</code>, <code>=</code>, and finally <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Complete the Course URL",
            "id": 152226,
            "contentType": "interactive",
